flowchart LR
    Owner[Fresh hosted owner]
    Form[Existing Leads LiveView<br/>company, contact, 1-3 exact source excerpts]
    Preview[OwnerIntake.preview<br/>read-only normalized preview]
    Commit[Explicit save<br/>binding then head lock, fresh owner and preview recheck]
    Sales[Sales scoped actions<br/>new Account or unchanged active Account<br/>new Contact and manual Lead]
    Origin[(Research OwnerProspectIntake<br/>OwnerProspectSource, append-only)]
    Payload[(Exact excerpt Payload)]
    Ledger[(Value-free Audit events)]
    Later[Separate existing assignment workflow<br/>not triggered by intake save]
    Reader[Research lead-source dispatcher<br/>one origin per lead, not per Account]
    Legacy[Legacy DossierSourceRead]
    Scoped[OwnerIntakeSourceRead<br/>running run, lead, live intake, exact hashes]
    Read[Scoped Payload action<br/>AGT identity, audited access, fail closed]
    Artifact[ResearchArtifact<br/>owner_intake, unverified, unknown freshness]
    Evidence[Claims and evidence bundle<br/>stable artifact lineage]
    Draft[Draft and review<br/>owner-supplied unverified disclosure when cited]

    Owner --> Form
    Form --> Preview
    Preview -- explicit confirmation --> Commit
    Commit -- atomic --> Sales
    Commit -- atomic --> Origin
    Commit -- scoped store --> Payload
    Commit -- same transaction --> Ledger
    Sales -. later explicit action only .-> Later
    Later --> Reader
    Reader -- dossier origin --> Legacy
    Reader -- owner origin --> Scoped
    Origin --> Scoped
    Scoped --> Read
    Read --> Payload
    Read -- payload_view access --> Ledger
    Read --> Artifact
    Artifact --> Evidence
    Evidence --> Draft

    %% Authority-compiled prototype runtime only. Ordinary builds refuse owner intake.
    %% Source-only feature diagram; it does not assert deployment or authorize a run.
    %% Intake performs no fetch, assignment, model invocation, or outreach.
    %% Mixed/missing origins and read failures refuse; sources never cross leads.
